<%= header_section("Your PayPal account can't receive your payout.") %>
<div>
  <p>Hi there. We tried to send you <%= @amount %> through PayPal, but <%= @reason %>.</p>
  <p>
    This will keep happening until you change how you get paid, so we've stopped retrying it. Your balance is safe and stays on your account.
  </p>
  <% if @can_use_bank_account %>
    <p>
      To get paid, <a href='<%= settings_payments_url %>'>add a bank account in your payout settings</a>, or switch to a different PayPal account that can receive US dollars.
    </p>
  <% else %>
    <p>
      PayPal is the only payout method we can offer in your country, so to get paid you'll need to
      <a href='<%= settings_payments_url %>'>use a different PayPal account</a> that can receive US dollars.
    </p>
  <% end %>
  <% if @payouts_on_hold %>
    <p>
      Payouts on your account are also on hold. Once a working payout method is on file, reply to this email and we'll review the hold and release your balance.
    </p>
  <% elsif @payouts_paused_by_seller %>
    <p>
      Payouts on your account are also paused in your settings. Once a working payout method is on file and you
      <a href='<%= settings_payments_url %>'>resume payouts there</a>, your balance will be sent on the next payout date.
    </p>
  <% else %>
    <p>
      Your balance will be sent on the next payout date after that.
    </p>
  <% end %>
</div>
